<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian June unemployment 4.5 pct vs 4.4 in May.</title>
<headline>Austrian June unemployment 4.5 pct vs 4.4 in May.</headline>
<text>
<p>VIENNA, July 2, Reuter - The Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	(JUNE)	(MAY)     (JUNE 1996)</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	4.5	  4.4	    4.3</p>
<p> Total			    193,796    210,993	188,750</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
